sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant B as MQTT broker
    participant S as Shadow service
    Note over C,S: R = $vc/devices/device-1/shadow/name/tutorial
    C->>B: SUBSCRIBE R/update/accepted and R/update/rejected
    B-->>C: SUBACK success
    C->>B: PUBLISH R/update<br/>JSON patch, QoS 1
    B-->>C: PUBACK
    B->>S: Forward authorized request
    alt Patch accepted
        S-->>B: R/update/accepted
        B-->>C: R/update/accepted
    else Invalid patch or version conflict
        S-->>B: R/update/rejected<br/>code, message, clientToken
        B-->>C: R/update/rejected
    end
    Note over C,S: Other subscribers may also receive responses<br/>Correlate by clientToken where provided
